This product includes software developed for the WUCI-JI project.

This package contains an Orange program and an interpreter bridge for
Daylight Horizon v17's cryptographic mechanics. It follows the Apache-2.0
Daylight v17 Horizon and v15 Meridian sources at upstream revision
fec91dc6618d477908790520118bae7e25909c43, and the pure-Python reference in
test_daylight.py is adapted from the v15 Meridian AEAD reference.

The new/modified material is daylight-horizon.or, daylight.py,
test_daylight.py, README.md and validation.txt. The original port was
AI-assisted with OpenAI Codex; the rewrite in the language as it stands was
AI-assisted with Claude Code at the owner's direction. No Noether Forge
initramfs patches are included.
